1
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:34,900
The second round is a contest of wits!

2
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:43,500
You announced it just now.
And it was written on the...

3
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:50,500
You secretly changed the order!

4
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:56,900
Oh no! If Fu wins, I'll have to
take my opponent on in martial arts!

5
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:03,900
Both contestants are on stage.
Reverend Yichan will set the question

6
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:11,900
Amitabha. Nothing is more difficult
to attain in life than perfection

7
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:17,700
More is too heavy,
less is too light

8
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:24,700
My question is,
what is more and yet light?

9
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:31,500
More and yet light? You're obviously
trying to make things difficult!

10
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,500
You're oversensitive, sir

11
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:43,900
Since this is a test of wits, it can't
possibly be an ordinary question

12
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:49,900
For example, this bag is full of air
yet it's light

13
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:53,900
So it's not impossible to find
an answer to the Reverend's question

14
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:59,900
Ouyang Xiaotian is really despicable.
He got Shi Yaoqian to give an example

15
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:03,900
That way, Fu wouldn't be able to
use that as an answer

16
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:05,900
We must think of something else now

17
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:11,500
What could be lighter than air
in this world?

18
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:15,900
I've prepared a bag for each of you

19
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:20,900
You have a joss stick's time
to fill it with something

20
00:03:20,900 --> 00:03:27,500
Whoever's bag is the fullest
yet the lightest is the winner

21
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:33,300
Thank you

22
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:38,700
Don't worry, Fuqi-ge is bright.
He'll be able to solve the quiz

23
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:43,500
Yes, he's bright,
but his luck is never good

24
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:48,500
The first day he went to school,
he lost his book and got a dressing-down

25
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:52,900
After he grew up, he worked in a rice
shop which was later burnt to ashes

26
00:03:52,900 --> 00:03:55,900
How can I not worry about him?

27
00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:58,900
It's yourself you're worried about

28
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:02,500
Don't you worry about yourself too?

29
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:08,900
Since I was a child,
I've been known to be a lucky star

30
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:13,500
I'll bring luck to Fuqi-ge too.
Don't worry

31
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:16,700
What are you looking at?

32
00:04:26,900 --> 00:04:30,700
Take your time.
And rack your brains

33
00:04:41,900 --> 00:04:45,900
This isn't difficult.
Why is Wu Fuqi racking his brains?

34
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:51,900
It's not difficult to fill the bag, but
to make sure his is lighter isn't easy

35
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:55,500
This round is crucial.
He can't afford to lose

36
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:04,500
They're back so soon.
What could be in the bag?

37
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:07,500
Half more joss stick to go!

38
00:05:07,900 --> 00:05:10,500
Please help us...

39
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:15,700
You'll lose for sure!

40
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:27,780
Wu Fuqi, why are you
always so unlucky?

41
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:44,500
I doubt Wu Fuqi is going to win

42
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:48,900
If he loses, there'll be no point
in carrying on the duel

43
00:05:48,900 --> 00:05:51,900
It's still too early to say
who will win

44
00:05:52,900 --> 00:05:53,900
Indeed

45
00:05:56,900 --> 00:06:01,500
Heaven, please give me
some luck (fuqi)

46
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:05,700
Fuqi...

47
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:09,900
Fuqi?
I've got it

48
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:14,900
Fuqi?
I've got it!

49
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:17,900
Shuangxi!

50
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:32,900
What is he doing? Time is running out!
What's he saying to Shuangxi?

51
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:36,900
They aren't chatting.
He wants her to get something for him

52
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:39,500
Is he out of his mind?

53
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:43,500
This concerns our entire family
and he entrusted the task to her?

54
00:06:43,900 --> 00:06:44,900
Go!

55
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:51,500
I'm sure Fu will be able to make it

56
00:06:53,900 --> 00:06:55,900
Time is running out

57
00:06:55,900 --> 00:07:00,500
If Shuangxi can't come back in time,
it'll be no use...

58
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:03,500
no matter how good his idea is

59
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:10,900
Time is almost up.
Have you got it ready, Wu Fuqi?

60
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:13,700
If you haven't, admit defeat

61
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:17,900
It's still too early to say
who will win!

62
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:42,900
What took you so long?
I was worried sick!

63
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:44,900
It wasn't easy to get them

64
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:45,900
Thanks!

65
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:48,900
I'm ready!

66
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:56,900
Let me see what you've got
in your bags

67
00:07:56,900 --> 00:07:58,900
This is mine

68
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:08,900
Two liang

69
00:08:09,900 --> 00:08:15,900
This bagful is only a stone's weight?

70
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:24,900
It wasn't easy for you to get it
in such a short time at all

71
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:31,900
Feathers?
Good!

72
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:36,900
Feathers should be the lightest
of all things in the world

73
00:08:36,900 --> 00:08:39,900
Well done, Master Chen

74
00:08:40,900 --> 00:08:43,500
Master Wu, it's your turn

75
00:08:56,900 --> 00:08:58,900
It's not even half a liang

76
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:06,900
By rights, Master Chen's bagful of
feathers should be the lightest

77
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:13,500
But Master Wu's bag is actually
lighter than his

78
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:16,500
How incredible!

79
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:22,500
What's inside, Wu Fuqi?
Is it air?

80
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:26,500
Don't you break the rule
like Wei Delu did

81
00:09:26,900 --> 00:09:30,900
You broke the rule...

82
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:37,900
Relax!
I did nothing of the sort!

83
00:09:40,500 --> 00:09:45,900
Please tell us what's in the bag then

84
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:48,900
No problem, Reverend

85
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:55,900
Please give me a hand

86
00:09:57,900 --> 00:10:01,500
-What on earth are you up to?
-Watch carefully

87
00:10:05,900 --> 00:10:07,900
I've got it...!

88
00:10:12,700 --> 00:10:13,900
It's light!

89
00:10:14,900 --> 00:10:16,500
Master Wu...

90
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:23,700
It's light in my bag.
It's a bag filled with light

91
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:29,900
I get it now.
Excellent! Excellent...!

92
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:32,900
My son is really bright!

93
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:37,900
You filled the entire bag with
the light given out by the fireflies

94
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:42,900
And because the fireflies
fly in the air,

95
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:46,900
it doesn't add any weight
to the bag at all

96
00:10:46,900 --> 00:10:50,900
As a result, your bag is lighter
than the weight of half a stone

97
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:54,900
-Brilliant indeed!
-Brilliant!

98
00:10:54,900 --> 00:10:58,700
Truly brilliant!

99
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:04,700
Master Wu is the winner of this round

100
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:12,900
I win...! I win...!

101
00:11:23,900 --> 00:11:26,700
My son wins...!

102
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:31,500
Studying without thinking is no use!
It's more important to be quick-witted!

103
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:33,900
He was just lucky

104
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:38,900
Didn't I see an old hen begging for mercy
just now? How fast the weather's changed!

105
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:42,900
It's bright and sunny now,
thanks to my son!

106
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:51,500
You're no longer unlucky, Fu!

107
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:58,500
I owe it all to Shuangxi. Since I
got to know her, I've been in luck!

108
00:11:58,900 --> 00:12:02,500
Kicking me away now that you have
a wife? Aren't you unfilial!

109
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:08,700
Come on, simmer down, or you'll
get wrinkles and he'll dump you!

110
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:09,900
I dare him to do that!

111
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:12,900
Fancy you teasing your own mother!

112
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:14,900
Shuangxi, you must take him in hand

113
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,700
Congratulations, Fuqi-ge!

114
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:21,900
I should thank you. It's your
fortune bag that gave me the idea

115
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:25,900
No, you owe it to your intelligence.
I'd never have thought of the idea

116
00:12:25,900 --> 00:12:27,900
You brought me luck, that's why!

117
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:32,500
Lu! Shou!

118
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,500
I won!

119
00:12:57,900 --> 00:13:00,500
Are you sulking?

120
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:03,400
Nothing in this world is certain

121
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:08,400
You've only lost one round and you
can't take it? Are you such a bad loser?

122
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:14,400
It's a draw at the moment. Let's just
see what happens in the third round

123
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:24,400
Fu won. Does it mean we won't
have to be sent into exile?

124
00:13:27,900 --> 00:13:32,900
Shou will have to win
the third round too, Mother

125
00:13:32,900 --> 00:13:38,900
You still need to take part in the duel?
That won't do, Shou...!

126
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:43,900
You were lucky to have won in the
second round. As for the third...

127
00:13:44,900 --> 00:13:46,500
Good luck

128
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:49,900
Don't be cocky!

129
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:54,500
How can one not worry,
given the state of your health?

130
00:13:55,900 --> 00:13:59,900
It's your health which is worrying!

131
00:13:59,900 --> 00:14:03,700
You might get killed up there, Shou!

132
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:06,500
Say something!
Don't scare me!

133
00:14:06,500 --> 00:14:11,500
Relax, if anything happens,
you'll be able to get a good coffin

134
00:14:11,900 --> 00:14:15,900
What do you have against us?
Why are you cursing us?

135
00:14:15,900 --> 00:14:19,700
I'm not. I'm just trying to
comfort your mother

136
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:22,900
By asking her to get a coffin?

137
00:14:24,900 --> 00:14:27,900
Knock it off!
Get off my back!

138
00:14:29,500 --> 00:14:35,500
Shou, you mustn't have the duel.
You'll get killed. Don't go!

139
00:14:36,900 --> 00:14:40,900
Mother, if anything happens to me,
take it that I'm an unfilial son!

140
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:44,900
No, Shou...!
You mustn't go!

141
00:14:45,900 --> 00:14:49,900
Shou, you're white as a sheet.
Can you do it? Don't force yourself

142
00:14:50,500 --> 00:14:51,500
Sure I can!

143
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:55,900
Go for it.
We're counting on you

144
00:14:57,500 --> 00:15:00,500
I don't have a choice now

145
00:15:01,900 --> 00:15:03,900
Go for it!

146
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:23,500
The third round - martial arts. It's
Mei Shouquan versus Iron Arms Li Dali

147
00:15:24,500 --> 00:15:30,500
The purpose of a duel is to
exchange pointers, not to kill

148
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:33,900
The rule for this round is,

149
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:38,500
whoever throws his opponent
off the stage is the winner

150
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:02,500
Go for it!

151
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:21,900
Keep it up!

152
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:28,900
Get rid of the invalid
and the vermins!

153
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:31,500
That's enough!

154
00:16:32,780 --> 00:16:34,900
-Shut up!
-Enough is enough!

155
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:39,900
We may have given you
a lot of trouble,

156
00:16:39,900 --> 00:16:43,900
but you shouldn't hit a person
when he's down!

157
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:49,900
You're afraid we might bring you
bad luck, diseases and lawsuits

158
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:51,900
That's why you call us
the three vermins!

159
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:58,900
Tell me - who have we harmed?
Who have we harmed?!

160
00:16:58,900 --> 00:17:01,900
Who have we harmed?!

161
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:07,700
Do you enjoy seeing Shou get
beaten up? Aren't you inhuman!

162
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:09,900
Well said, Lu!

163
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:14,500
They have a foul mouth,
and they're all crazy!

164
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:33,500
Hit him hard!

165
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:36,900
He's simply no match for him!

166
00:17:36,900 --> 00:17:42,500
Shut your trap!
We're all in the same boat

167
00:17:42,500 --> 00:17:47,900
If Shou loses,
all of us will be in the soup!

168
00:17:48,900 --> 00:17:52,500
Hitting and banging didn't work.
I'm finished...

169
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:56,900
-What are you doing?
-I'm making a white flag

170
00:17:56,900 --> 00:18:00,300
I can't let him be beaten to death

171
00:18:03,700 --> 00:18:04,700
No!

172
00:18:06,900 --> 00:18:11,500
Give it up, lad! You might still
be able to go home alive then

173
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:16,900
If I surrender now, I wouldn't be
Mei Shouquan! Dream on!

174
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:19,700
Fine! Go to hell then!

175
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:31,500
Shou!

176
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:43,900
Shou!

177
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:46,900
-What now? Shall we throw him the flag?
-Do that!

178
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:52,900
No! Once we surrender,
we'll all have to be sent into exile!

179
00:18:56,900 --> 00:18:59,500
Good!
Harder!

180
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:01,500
Uncle...!

181
00:19:09,900 --> 00:19:10,900
Shou!

182
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:17,900
Get up, Uncle! Use the skill
Ma-jiejie taught you to beat him!

183
00:19:17,900 --> 00:19:21,900
In the Five-Animal Boxing, you fuse
with the surroundings and use...

184
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:23,900
your opponent's force to beat himself

185
00:19:33,900 --> 00:19:35,500
Uncle...!

186
00:19:44,900 --> 00:19:46,900
Look! What is he doing?

187
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:48,900
Uncle will win for sure!

188
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:08,900
What's he doing?

189
00:20:35,900 --> 00:20:37,700
He won?

190
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:09,900
Ouyang Xiaotian!

191
00:21:16,900 --> 00:21:17,900
Thanks!

192
00:21:18,900 --> 00:21:19,900
Jiujin!

193
00:21:53,900 --> 00:21:56,500
What's your decision, Your Highness?

194
00:21:57,900 --> 00:22:01,900
You said you were well-versed in pen and
sword and the best man to be my husband

195
00:22:01,900 --> 00:22:05,500
But it's proven that there are
other people stronger than you

196
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:10,900
All right, I've admitted defeat

197
00:22:10,900 --> 00:22:15,900
Do I still have to kowtow
to you to ask for your hand?

198
00:22:15,900 --> 00:22:17,900
That trick won't work on me

199
00:22:17,900 --> 00:22:21,900
It was really nice of Wei Delu
and his friends to stand up for me

200
00:22:21,900 --> 00:22:26,900
But you threatened to send them into
exile. What you did was too much

201
00:22:27,500 --> 00:22:32,500
I see. It's been a few days.
I doubt they still take it to heart

202
00:22:32,900 --> 00:22:36,900
I think you should apologize to them

203
00:22:38,900 --> 00:22:43,500
What did I do wrong?
You need to have rules in a duel

204
00:22:43,500 --> 00:22:46,500
It's too difficult
for me to apologize to them

205
00:22:46,500 --> 00:22:48,500
What's so difficult?

206
00:22:48,500 --> 00:22:53,500
Since you don't listen to me,
we won't be happy together

207
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:57,500
Are you joking, Your Highness?

208
00:22:57,500 --> 00:22:59,500
I'm not

209
00:22:59,500 --> 00:23:02,900
I've vowed that I must find a man
who yields to me completely,

210
00:23:02,900 --> 00:23:04,900
or I'd rather remain single

211
00:23:04,900 --> 00:23:10,900
You lost the duel but are still
so high and mighty. It scares me

212
00:23:12,900 --> 00:23:14,900
What do you intend to do then?

213
00:23:14,900 --> 00:23:16,900
I want to go back to the Capital

214
00:23:18,900 --> 00:23:23,900
All right, we'll discuss that.
I'll escort you

215
00:23:23,900 --> 00:23:27,900
Why should I discuss it with you?
Do I need your permission to go?

216
00:23:27,900 --> 00:23:31,700
I'm not a bird in a cage.
I'm free to do whatever I like

217
00:23:31,900 --> 00:23:35,900
Sure, sure.
Please simmer down

218
00:23:35,900 --> 00:23:38,900
I'll visit you again another day

219
00:23:48,900 --> 00:23:50,900
Why did you argue again?

220
00:23:50,900 --> 00:23:53,900
It was all his fault!

221
00:23:53,900 --> 00:23:58,900
To think he didn't ask me to stay when
I said I wanted to return to the Capital!

222
00:23:58,900 --> 00:24:00,900
So what do we do now?

223
00:24:00,900 --> 00:24:04,900
Since I said I was leaving,
I have to or I'll be laughed at

224
00:24:04,900 --> 00:24:07,500
I'll make him worry about me

225
00:24:23,700 --> 00:24:28,700
Thank you so much for getting back
at Ouyang Xiaotian for me!

226
00:24:28,900 --> 00:24:32,900
It was really bold of him
to show you disrespect

227
00:24:32,900 --> 00:24:35,900
He should long have been
taught a lesson!

228
00:24:35,900 --> 00:24:36,900
Right!

229
00:24:36,900 --> 00:24:39,900
Enough about him.
I'm returning to the Capital

230
00:24:39,900 --> 00:24:41,900
You're leaving?

231
00:24:41,900 --> 00:24:46,900
But because of the duel, you and
your families suffered a lot

232
00:24:46,900 --> 00:24:51,900
I feel really bad. So before I leave,
I'll call on you to say goodbye

233
00:24:52,900 --> 00:24:58,900
You're too kind. My mother and sister
will be elated at the news

234
00:25:00,900 --> 00:25:06,900
We don't deserve such kindness. You're
a princess and we're only commoners

235
00:25:06,900 --> 00:25:11,900
My place is too shabby
to receive you, Your Highness

236
00:25:11,900 --> 00:25:16,500
Don't say that. My father tells me
a country's priority is its people

237
00:25:18,500 --> 00:25:22,500
Without the people, there will be
no country. So don't turn me down anymore

238
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:25,500
In that case, we'll oblige

239
00:25:25,500 --> 00:25:28,500
We'll do our best to protect you

240
00:25:28,500 --> 00:25:29,900
We'll protect you

241
00:25:30,900 --> 00:25:32,900
How come I don't see Miss Ma?

242
00:25:32,900 --> 00:25:34,900
She's injured

243
00:25:34,900 --> 00:25:40,900
I wonder if it's true. She didn't
help us at all at the duel

244
00:25:40,900 --> 00:25:42,500
Outrageous!

245
00:25:42,900 --> 00:25:47,900
We were lucky to have survived
the duel without her help

246
00:25:47,900 --> 00:25:51,500
Can she escort me back to the Capital
then? What if she can't?

247
00:25:53,900 --> 00:25:56,900
-It's all right. You still have us
-That's right

248
00:25:56,900 --> 00:26:01,500
We're lucky stars.
We'll be able to protect you!

249
00:26:01,500 --> 00:26:02,500
No problem

250
00:26:02,500 --> 00:26:06,900
No. It's a thousand li
from here to the Capital

251
00:26:06,900 --> 00:26:09,500
I'll be worried without her escort

252
00:26:11,900 --> 00:26:16,900
To think she insists on getting
Golden Swallow to escort her

253
00:26:16,900 --> 00:26:20,500
The Capital is so far away.
Her worry is valid

254
00:26:20,900 --> 00:26:26,500
If anything happens to her,
we won't be able to account for it

255
00:26:28,500 --> 00:26:33,900
So ultimately we still have to get
Spicy Woman to help us? We'll lose face

256
00:26:34,900 --> 00:26:38,900
You have to accept the fact. We aren't
as good as her in martial arts

257
00:26:39,900 --> 00:26:43,700
No. I must think of another way out

258
00:26:46,900 --> 00:26:49,900
Can't we get someone
to pose as Golden Swallow?

259
00:26:49,900 --> 00:26:52,500
An imposter?

260
00:26:52,900 --> 00:26:58,900
We won't have to put up with her
during the journey then

261
00:26:58,900 --> 00:27:03,900
And she won't be able to
nag at us. So why not?

262
00:27:03,900 --> 00:27:05,900
But who should we get to pose as her?

263
00:27:07,900 --> 00:27:09,900
I've got it!

264
00:27:10,900 --> 00:27:13,900
So have I!

265
00:27:17,900 --> 00:27:21,900
You're escorting Her Highness back to
the Capital? That's great! Do your best!

266
00:27:21,900 --> 00:27:27,700
Shuangxi is quick-witted and bright.
She'll be able to help us

267
00:27:27,900 --> 00:27:31,900
You'll have her company
throughout the journey this way

268
00:27:31,900 --> 00:27:33,900
I know what you're thinking of

269
00:27:34,900 --> 00:27:37,500
What does he mean?

270
00:27:37,900 --> 00:27:39,900
We need a favour from you

271
00:27:39,900 --> 00:27:43,500
How can I help?
I only know how to sell watermelons

272
00:27:43,900 --> 00:27:48,900
Can you escort Her Highness
back to the Capital together with us?

273
00:27:48,900 --> 00:27:52,500
She has so many attendants.
Why does she still need me?

274
00:27:52,500 --> 00:27:55,500
You won't have to wait on her.
Just protect her!

275
00:27:55,900 --> 00:27:58,500
Protect her? How?

276
00:27:58,900 --> 00:28:04,500
We need you to pose as Golden Swallow
to escort Her Highness

277
00:28:05,900 --> 00:28:07,900
I can't...
Why me?

278
00:28:07,900 --> 00:28:11,500
Her Highness will be worried
unless Golden Swallow tags along

279
00:28:12,900 --> 00:28:16,900
But Golden Swallow has the sword
given by His Majesty. I don't

280
00:28:17,900 --> 00:28:22,500
Don't worry. You only have to stand next
to Her Highness to scare people off

281
00:28:22,900 --> 00:28:25,900
What if someone
sees through my disguise?

282
00:28:25,900 --> 00:28:31,900
Just look cold and not say a word,
and people will be scared off

283
00:28:32,900 --> 00:28:34,300
Look cold?

284
00:28:34,900 --> 00:28:40,900
What's the purpose of putting
scarecrows in the fields?

285
00:28:40,900 --> 00:28:43,500
-To scare off birds!
-Right

286
00:28:43,900 --> 00:28:47,900
Tell you what.
We'll test Her Highness first

287
00:28:47,900 --> 00:28:51,900
If she can't see through Shuangxi's
disguise, we'll have succeeded!

288
00:28:54,900 --> 00:28:55,900
Let's go

289
00:28:55,900 --> 00:28:57,900
Where are my watermelons?

290
00:28:59,500 --> 00:29:00,500
Sorry...

291
00:29:00,500 --> 00:29:01,500
Hurry!

292
00:29:06,900 --> 00:29:11,500
You're almost of the same build.
Who'd dare say you're not Golden Swallow?

293
00:29:11,900 --> 00:29:13,900
Turn one round

294
00:29:14,500 --> 00:29:15,500
Again

295
00:29:17,900 --> 00:29:19,900
But I'm still worried

296
00:29:20,900 --> 00:29:27,500
Relax. You won't really need to fight.
This is just to scare people off

297
00:29:27,900 --> 00:29:34,500
That's right. If you're scared yourself,
how will you be able to scare people?

298
00:29:34,500 --> 00:29:35,500
Stay calm

299
00:29:35,500 --> 00:29:37,500
Here comes Her Highness

300
00:29:37,900 --> 00:29:39,500
This way, please

301
00:29:43,900 --> 00:29:46,900
Your Highness, someone is
waiting for you

302
00:29:46,900 --> 00:29:48,900
-Who?
-Look

303
00:29:50,900 --> 00:29:53,900
Golden Swallow!
I've missed you!

304
00:29:53,900 --> 00:29:58,900
They told me you couldn't go to
the Capital with me. I was so worried

305
00:30:00,900 --> 00:30:02,900
Why are you trembling?

306
00:30:03,900 --> 00:30:04,900
No...

307
00:30:04,900 --> 00:30:08,500
-She's injured
-She's down with flu

308
00:30:08,500 --> 00:30:10,500
Is she injured or down with flu?

309
00:30:10,900 --> 00:30:14,900
I got injured when I was
after some bandits

310
00:30:14,900 --> 00:30:17,900
Then I caught a cold
while recuperating

311
00:30:17,900 --> 00:30:19,900
That's right

312
00:30:20,900 --> 00:30:24,900
You're in quite bad shape. Even your
voice has changed. Can you escort me?

313
00:30:24,900 --> 00:30:28,500
No problem.
Fuqi-ge and I will protect you...

314
00:30:29,900 --> 00:30:32,900
Golden Swallow really likes to joke

315
00:30:32,900 --> 00:30:38,900
She thinks she'll bring me luck if
she calls me Fuqi-ge like Shuangxi does

316
00:30:38,900 --> 00:30:43,500
I see. I'll be going then.
We're setting off in a few days

317
00:30:43,500 --> 00:30:44,500
Goodbye!

318
00:30:47,900 --> 00:30:49,500
Take care!

319
00:30:53,900 --> 00:30:57,900
You nearly gave us away.
I had such a fright

320
00:30:57,900 --> 00:31:01,900
I was too tense, that was why.
It won't happen again

321
00:31:01,900 --> 00:31:06,500
I won't hold it against you

322
00:31:08,900 --> 00:31:14,900
Good for you. Lu has Her Highness
and you, Shuangxi. I'm all alone

323
00:31:14,900 --> 00:31:17,500
Come over

324
00:31:18,900 --> 00:31:20,900
I'll lend you a shoulder

325
00:31:37,900 --> 00:31:39,900
Uncle, did you ask for me?

326
00:31:39,900 --> 00:31:42,900
Jiujin! Let me ask you something

327
00:31:43,900 --> 00:31:46,500
-Is haw candy nice?
-Yes

328
00:31:46,500 --> 00:31:49,900
-Crispy date biscuit?
-Yes

329
00:31:49,900 --> 00:31:52,900
-Fried dough twist? Candy fire?
-All are nice

330
00:31:52,900 --> 00:31:55,900
-Are they all yummy?
-Yes

331
00:31:56,500 --> 00:32:02,500
If you answer my questions,
I'll buy you all those goodies

332
00:32:03,900 --> 00:32:08,900
What's Ma-jiejie suffering from?
Did she tell you?

333
00:32:08,900 --> 00:32:11,500
I don't know
what she's suffering from

334
00:32:11,900 --> 00:32:14,900
How could it be?
She didn't tell you?

335
00:32:14,900 --> 00:32:15,900
No

336
00:32:15,900 --> 00:32:16,900
She really didn't?

337
00:32:16,900 --> 00:32:18,900
-She only said...
-Yes?

338
00:32:18,900 --> 00:32:22,500
-That she had a sore
-A sore? Where?

339
00:32:22,900 --> 00:32:24,900
-I don't know
-You don't know?

340
00:32:25,900 --> 00:32:29,900
Aren't you useless.
Girls are supposed to be nosey

341
00:32:29,900 --> 00:32:32,900
If you aren't nosey enough,
you're not a girl

342
00:32:32,900 --> 00:32:38,900
Don't think I'm useless. I know every
girl is particular about her looks

343
00:32:38,900 --> 00:32:41,900
If there's a sore on her face,
she'll panic

344
00:32:41,900 --> 00:32:46,700
No wonder she's always wearing a veil
so that we don't see her face

345
00:32:46,900 --> 00:32:52,500
She doesn't want us
to know more about her?

346
00:32:52,500 --> 00:32:57,900
No wonder you promised to buy me
goodies. You're doing it for Ma-jiejie

347
00:32:58,900 --> 00:33:03,900
I'm sorry, Jiujin.
Don't be angry

348
00:33:10,900 --> 00:33:14,900
Mother, why are there only clothes?
What about food and money?

349
00:33:15,900 --> 00:33:18,900
You're just not as smart as me

350
00:33:18,900 --> 00:33:21,900
Since you're travelling
with Her Highness,

351
00:33:21,900 --> 00:33:24,900
you'll get to eat
whatever delicacies she has

352
00:33:24,900 --> 00:33:27,500
Would you need to bring any food?

353
00:33:28,900 --> 00:33:32,500
Smart woman!
What about money then?

354
00:33:33,500 --> 00:33:38,900
All the more you need not worry,
since Lu and Shou will be with you

355
00:33:39,900 --> 00:33:41,900
You can't be serious

356
00:33:42,900 --> 00:33:45,900
I have your interests at heart

357
00:33:45,900 --> 00:33:50,500
Don't use your own money.
Save it up for your wedding

358
00:33:51,500 --> 00:33:55,500
As for your expenses,
use your sworn brothers' money

359
00:33:55,500 --> 00:33:57,500
That's what sworn brothers are for

360
00:33:59,900 --> 00:34:04,900
You want me to ask them for money
every day throughout the journey?

361
00:34:05,900 --> 00:34:09,900
Don't put it that way. You should
share it if you have something good

362
00:34:10,900 --> 00:34:17,500
But remember not to share a room with
Shou in case he passes you some disease

363
00:34:17,900 --> 00:34:22,900
Shouldn't we share trouble as well
when it strikes?

364
00:34:24,900 --> 00:34:28,900
You're down on your luck. Will you still
be able to share other people's trouble?

365
00:34:30,500 --> 00:34:34,900
One more thing. When there's credit,
be the first to claim it

366
00:34:34,900 --> 00:34:37,900
Leave all the dangerous tasks to them

367
00:34:37,900 --> 00:34:41,900
Who will look after me if something
happens to you otherwise?

368
00:34:41,900 --> 00:34:45,500
Between filial piety and loyalty,
you can only choose one

369
00:34:51,900 --> 00:34:54,900
My mother is really a shrewd one

370
00:35:10,900 --> 00:35:12,900
Hurry...!

371
00:35:13,900 --> 00:35:16,900
Have you swept the floor?
It's dirty

372
00:35:19,900 --> 00:35:25,500
It's just Her Highness coming.
No need to go to such lengths

373
00:35:25,900 --> 00:35:27,900
Mother, Her Highness is here!

374
00:35:29,900 --> 00:35:31,900
Are you all right?

375
00:35:36,700 --> 00:35:38,700
Our respects to Your Highness

376
00:35:38,900 --> 00:35:41,900
-Please rise
-Thank you, Your Highness

377
00:35:42,900 --> 00:35:45,900
Please come in, Your Highness

378
00:35:58,700 --> 00:36:01,900
-Please have a seat, Your Highness
-You too

379
00:36:01,900 --> 00:36:02,900
Thank you

380
00:36:02,900 --> 00:36:04,900
Please have some tea!

381
00:36:05,900 --> 00:36:08,900
Mrs Mei, Her Highness knows
Master Mei is weak in constitution

382
00:36:08,900 --> 00:36:12,900
Here's some ginseng and lingzhi
for him to build himself up

383
00:36:12,900 --> 00:36:16,500
It's also to thank him
for winning the duel

384
00:36:16,900 --> 00:36:18,900
We don't deserve it!

385
00:36:18,900 --> 00:36:20,900
You're too kind, Your Highness

386
00:36:20,900 --> 00:36:23,900
You deserve the gifts
for doing so much for me

387
00:36:23,900 --> 00:36:28,500
Please don't say that. I've long wanted
to teach Ouyang Xiaotian a lesson!

388
00:36:28,900 --> 00:36:31,900
He isn't as bad as you think actually

389
00:36:31,900 --> 00:36:37,500
But he tried to force you to marry him.
He has no respect for you at all!

390
00:36:37,900 --> 00:36:42,900
It's all in the past. Please don't dwell
on it or hold it against him anymore

391
00:36:42,900 --> 00:36:46,500
No! He's just too much!

392
00:36:46,500 --> 00:36:49,500
I said just forget it.
Don't argue with me anymore

393
00:36:49,500 --> 00:36:54,500
Since you're so magnanimous,
we'll forgive him then

394
00:36:54,900 --> 00:37:00,500
I'm glad to hear that. No matter
what, you must accept the gifts

395
00:37:02,700 --> 00:37:03,700
Thank you

396
00:37:03,900 --> 00:37:08,900
I'm here also to tell you I'll be
returning to the Capital tomorrow

397
00:37:08,900 --> 00:37:11,900
So soon?
Won't you stay a few more days?

398
00:37:11,900 --> 00:37:16,900
The scenery in Ping'an Town
is beautiful

399
00:37:16,900 --> 00:37:18,900
Stay longer to admire it

400
00:37:19,900 --> 00:37:22,900
Please have some tea.
Have it while it's hot

401
00:37:22,900 --> 00:37:24,900
-I have something to discuss with you
-What is it?

402
00:37:24,900 --> 00:37:27,900
Since Her Highness
trusts you so much,

403
00:37:27,900 --> 00:37:31,900
why not ask her to be
Jiujin's godsister?

404
00:37:31,900 --> 00:37:33,900
We'll be in her good books then

405
00:37:35,900 --> 00:37:39,500
-I don't think that's a good idea
-What's wrong with it?

406
00:37:40,900 --> 00:37:45,900
This is our one and only chance.
Do me the favour

407
00:37:46,900 --> 00:37:48,900
Please have the tea!

408
00:37:50,900 --> 00:37:56,900
Your Highness, you're a royal,
and our very special guest

409
00:37:56,900 --> 00:38:00,900
What do you say my daughter
becomes your godsister?

410
00:38:00,900 --> 00:38:02,900
This is just to form ties

411
00:38:03,900 --> 00:38:09,900
Jiujin, Her Highness adores you! Go on
your knees, kowtow and call her Godsister

412
00:38:09,900 --> 00:38:12,900
On your knees, Jiujin!

413
00:38:13,700 --> 00:38:15,700
Watch your manners, Sis!

414
00:38:15,900 --> 00:38:21,900
What's wrong with you? You could
rattle on and on at other times

415
00:38:22,700 --> 00:38:24,700
No! I only want Ma-jiejie!

416
00:38:25,900 --> 00:38:28,900
I said go on your knees!

417
00:38:28,900 --> 00:38:31,500
No! I only want Ma-jiejie...

418
00:38:31,900 --> 00:38:35,700
Hush, Jiujin.
Tell me why you only want Ma-jiejie

419
00:38:35,900 --> 00:38:40,500
Because Uncle likes Ma-jiejie.
Whoever he likes, I like too...

420
00:38:43,900 --> 00:38:48,900
Children are so innocent.
They often point out what we overlook

421
00:38:48,900 --> 00:38:50,900
Yes...
I mean, no...

422
00:38:51,900 --> 00:38:56,900
Usually the person involved
doesn't realize it. Do treasure her

423
00:38:56,900 --> 00:38:58,900
It's time I left

424
00:38:58,900 --> 00:39:00,900
I'll see you off

425
00:39:04,900 --> 00:39:07,900
This is to you, Your Highness

426
00:39:07,900 --> 00:39:09,900
Thank you, Old Master Wei

427
00:39:16,900 --> 00:39:20,900
After you return to the Capital,
we won't know when we'll meet again

428
00:39:20,900 --> 00:39:26,900
And it's a long journey.
So please eat your fill

429
00:39:26,900 --> 00:39:28,900
Give me a minute

430
00:39:30,900 --> 00:39:38,500
I've also prepared some ginseng
and lingzhi for you

431
00:39:38,900 --> 00:39:41,900
Let me know if you need anything else

432
00:39:45,700 --> 00:39:51,900
Father, Her Highness already had a lot
of food when she called on the others

433
00:39:53,900 --> 00:39:56,900
Please pardon me then

434
00:39:58,900 --> 00:40:02,900
Delu is escorting you back to the
Capital. Can I ask a favour of you?

435
00:40:03,900 --> 00:40:06,900
-Will you oblige me?
-Please say it

436
00:40:06,900 --> 00:40:11,900
For three generations, we have only
one male descendant. My biggest wish...

437
00:40:11,900 --> 00:40:16,900
Is for me to emerge as the top scholar
in the imperial exams. Right, Father?

438
00:40:16,900 --> 00:40:18,900
So you remember

439
00:40:18,900 --> 00:40:23,900
My father nags at me every day.
How can I possibly forget?

440
00:40:23,900 --> 00:40:25,900
-Right, Father?
-Be quiet

441
00:40:26,900 --> 00:40:29,900
Mind your manners

442
00:40:30,900 --> 00:40:35,900
What I'd like to ask of you is to
make him stay in the Capital

443
00:40:35,900 --> 00:40:37,900
Don't let him come back

444
00:40:37,900 --> 00:40:39,900
-Stay in the Capital?
-That's right

445
00:40:39,900 --> 00:40:43,700
I always tell him to go to the Capital
to sit the exams...

446
00:40:43,700 --> 00:40:45,700
but he never takes it seriously

447
00:40:45,900 --> 00:40:49,900
Please make sure he does well in
the exams before returning home

448
00:40:50,900 --> 00:40:53,900
Will that be all right?

449
00:40:55,900 --> 00:41:01,500
Father, Her Highness isn't your maid

450
00:41:01,500 --> 00:41:05,500
How could you make her
do things for you?

451
00:41:05,900 --> 00:41:09,900
Master Wei is learned.
He should do his part for the country

452
00:41:09,900 --> 00:41:13,900
Her Highness has agreed.
Not another word

453
00:41:14,900 --> 00:41:17,900
So I'll leave my son in your care,
Your Highness

454
00:41:19,700 --> 00:41:23,700
You sound as if you were entrusting
an orphan to her care

455
00:41:23,700 --> 00:41:25,700
Be quiet and sit down!

456
00:41:26,500 --> 00:41:27,500
Sit down!

457
00:41:33,900 --> 00:41:37,500
How could he have died just like that?

458
00:41:39,500 --> 00:41:44,900
My husband was a strong man.
Who'd have thought he'd die so soon...

459
00:41:47,900 --> 00:41:52,900
Don't be too upset. We'll go and
get a coffin afterwards...

460
00:41:52,900 --> 00:41:56,500
Your Highness!

461
00:41:56,900 --> 00:41:59,500
-Please rise
-Thank you, Your Highness

462
00:41:59,900 --> 00:42:01,900
Please take care, Old Master Wei

463
00:42:02,900 --> 00:42:05,900
Thank you for your concern.
I certainly will

464
00:42:05,900 --> 00:42:07,900
We're off, Father

465
00:42:07,900 --> 00:42:11,500
-Take care
-I will

466
00:42:17,900 --> 00:42:21,500
Her Highness is so concerned
about our welfare

467
00:42:21,900 --> 00:42:27,700
Young Master seems quite close to
Her Highness. You're in luck!

468
00:42:27,900 --> 00:42:31,900
If we've got a Prince Consort
in Ping'an Town, we won't be...

469
00:42:31,900 --> 00:42:33,900
the only family in luck

470
00:42:34,900 --> 00:42:36,500
True...

471
00:42:37,900 --> 00:42:39,900
What's the matter with her?

472
00:42:43,700 --> 00:42:46,700
Master, she's... dead!

473
00:42:46,700 --> 00:42:47,700
Dead?!

474
00:42:48,900 --> 00:42:54,700
What's this! She should've died
in her own house and not here!

475
00:42:54,900 --> 00:43:01,900
Death has struck many families
in Yangshu Town these few days

476
00:43:01,900 --> 00:43:06,900
All the victims had the same
symptoms. It bodes ill!

477
00:43:06,900 --> 00:43:08,900
It's a plague!

478
00:43:10,900 --> 00:43:16,900
No doubt about it!
Ping'an Town is no longer peaceful!

479
00:43:16,900 --> 00:43:21,900
To think I was just saying
we'd be in luck. Oh no...

480
00:43:36,900 --> 00:43:40,500
Jiujin!
Are you all right?

481
00:43:42,900 --> 00:43:46,700
-What's the din about?
-Jiujin is running a fever!

482
00:43:46,900 --> 00:43:50,500
Relax, she'll be all right

483
00:43:50,900 --> 00:43:54,500
Her forehead is hot, you know!

484
00:43:54,900 --> 00:43:59,500
Come on, Mother, children tend to
fall sick easily because they're weak

485
00:43:59,500 --> 00:44:01,900
No need to panic

486
00:44:02,500 --> 00:44:05,500
Don't say any more!
Go get a physician!

